132 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (Patriot Motorsports began in a student's garage. What started as a few students with a dream has grown into a full team with its own prototype bay at George Mason's Science and Technology campus in Manassas. After an extensive chassis redesign, we are now in full manufacturing, backed by material analysis and finite element analysis \(FEA\). Our Powertrain team is developing the engine and differential mounting and packaging, and our Electrical team has mapped the entire system and is designing the wiring harness ahead of fabrication. Two senior capstone projects are also underway: one is creating a front and rear wing aero package, and the other is designing and building a custom differential.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
